{% block content %}{% raw %}
<section class="page-hero has-img" data-screen-label="About — hero">
  <div class="ph-bg" data-parallax="0.1"><img fetchpriority="high" sizes="100vw" src="/images/IMG_6793.jpg" alt="Colorful temple in Koh Samui">
  </div>
  <div class="ph-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Travel became my way of life</p>
    <h1>Anaïs Zwald, Swiss travel planner in Thailand</h1>
    <p>Trained at the Geneva Hotel School, based in Thailand for over three years, specialising in tailor-made trips to Thailand and Southeast Asia.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-media tall img-reveal" data-reveal="left">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_1369.jpg" alt="Anaïs on a swing facing the sea">
        <span class="media-tag"><span class="dot"></span> Andaman Sea, Krabi</span>
      </div>
      <div class="split-text" data-reveal="right">
        <p class="eyebrow">My journey</p>
        <h2>From Geneva to southern Thailand</h2>
        <hr class="divider">
        <p>My name is Anaïs, a Swiss native trained at the Geneva Hotel School, for whom travel became more than a passion: a way of living and discovering the world.</p>
        <p>At 21, diploma in hand, I set off with all my savings for 6 months across Southeast Asia: the flavors of Vietnam, the islands of Indonesia, the jungle of Malaysia…</p>
        <p>But it was in Thailand, in the south of the country, that my heart found its anchor — won over by the kindness of the locals, the beauty of the landscapes and the richness of the local culture. When my friends and family started asking me for advice on their own trips, the idea for <strong>Zwald Travel Planner</strong> was born.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split reverse">
      <div class="split-media tall img-reveal" data-reveal="right">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_5227.jpg" alt="Anaïs at the golden temple of Doi Suthep, Chiang Mai">
        <span class="media-tag"><span class="dot"></span> Doi Suthep, Chiang Mai</span>
      </div>
      <div class="split-text" data-reveal="left">
        <p class="eyebrow">My home</p>
        <h2>Thailand, day to day</h2>
        <hr class="divider">
        <p>After 6 months traveling across Southeast Asia, this is where I settled down. I've been living here for over 3 years now, and I discover new sides of this incredible country every day.</p>
        <p>Encounters with elephants, golden temples, local markets, hidden beaches… These are the authentic experiences I want to share with you, through itineraries that go off the beaten path.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow center">My vision</p>
      <h2>Three convictions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid cols-3">
      <div class="card text-center" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><h3 class="script" style="color:var(--teal-dark)">Every traveler is unique</h3><p class="mt-s">There's no standard profile. Your trip starts with listening to who you are and what you're looking for.</p></div>
      <div class="card text-center" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><h3 class="script" style="color:var(--teal-dark)">Every trip deserves to be tailor-made</h3><p class="mt-s">No standardized tours, no off-the-shelf solutions. An itinerary designed for you, grounded in the reality on the ground.</p></div>
      <div class="card text-center" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><h3 class="script" style="color:var(--teal-dark)">A good trip is a well-prepared trip</h3><p class="mt-s">The adventure begins well before departure. Good preparation means peace of mind once you're there.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-navy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow center on-dark">Trust</p>
      <h2>Why trust me?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid cols-4">
      <div class="card" style="background:var(--navy-soft);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><h3 style="color:#fff">Real local expertise</h3><p style="color:var(--on-dark-mute)">I live in Asia and know the realities on the ground, beyond generic guides and blogs.</p></div>
      <div class="card" style="background:var(--navy-soft);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><h3 style="color:#fff">Total transparency</h3><p style="color:var(--on-dark-mute)">You're free to make your own bookings, with no hidden fees or commission. You know exactly what you're paying and why.</p></div>
      <div class="card" style="background:var(--navy-soft);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><h3 style="color:#fff">Personal support</h3><p style="color:var(--on-dark-mute)">Available before, during and after your trip. You're never alone when something unexpected comes up.</p></div>
      <div class="card" style="background:var(--navy-soft);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="4"><h3 style="color:#fff">Time saved</h3><p style="color:var(--on-dark-mute)">I spare you hours of research, hesitation and doubt.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band section-pad">
  <div class="ph-bg" data-parallax="0.12"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_1369.jpg" alt="View of the Andaman Sea"></div>
  <div class="ph-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow center on-dark" data-reveal style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:20px">Let's travel together</p>
    <h2 data-reveal>Ready to leave with peace of mind?</h2>
    <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">An itinerary built for you, that respects your budget, with someone you can trust by your side. I'd be delighted to guide you.</p>
    <div class="btns" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
      <a class="btn btn-white btn-lg" href="/en/contact/" data-magnetic><span>Contact me <svg class="arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
